              "id": "glog-946763f1-bdcd-4e7a-abcb-66f6782ac190",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "### Description\r\n\r\n**Vulnerability MAL-2023-1071** in the `pkg core` of the OSS programming language is a critical security flaw that allows for remote code execution (RCE) due to improper input validation. This vulnerability arises when untrusted input is processed without adequate sanitization, leading to potential exploitation by attackers to execute arbitrary code on the affected system.\r\n\r\n### General Mitigation Advice\r\n\r\n1. **Input Validation**: Ensure all inputs are validated and sanitized. Use whitelisting techniques to allow only expected input formats.\r\n2. **Update and Patch**: Regularly update the `pkg core` to the latest version where this vulnerability is patched.\r\n3. **Access Controls**: Implement strict access controls to limit exposure to potentially vulnerable components.\r\n4. **Monitoring and Logging**: Enable detailed logging and monitoring to detect any suspicious activities that may indicate exploitation attempts.\r\n\r\n### Source Code Fix Recommendation\r\n\r\nTo address this vulnerability, consider the following code fix:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# Before fix: vulnerable code\r\ndef process_input(user_input):\r\n    exec(user_input)  # Dangerous: allows execution of arbitrary code\r\n\r\n# After fix: secure code\r\nimport ast\r\n\r\ndef process_input(user_input):\r\n    # Parse the input safely using ast.literal_eval\r\n    try:\r\n        safe_input = ast.literal_eval(user_input)\r\n        # Process the safe input\r\n    except (ValueError, SyntaxError):\r\n        # Handle invalid input\r\n        pass\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Relevant OWASP Resources\r\n\r\n- [OWASP Top Ten](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\r\n- [OWASP Secure Coding Practices](https://owasp.org/www-project-secure-coding-practices-quick-reference-guide/)\r\n\r\n### Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)\r\n\r\n- [CWE-94: Improper Control of Generation of Code ('Code Injection')](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/94.html)"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "MAL-2023-1071/@zplayer:core:"
                ]
              }
            },
