 vulnerability is closely related to CWE-20, which involves the failure to properly validate input data. More information can be found on the [CWE website](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/20.html).\n\nPlease ensure to verify the links and their accessibility for anonymous users before including them in any reports or documentation."
