              "id": "glog-493b117a-dadf-4a78-a647-d3f273d7b332",
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "### Description\r\n\r\n**CVE-2015-2597** is a vulnerability found in the Java Runtime Environment (JRE) component of Oracle Java SE. This vulnerability allows remote attackers to affect confidentiality, integrity, and availability via unknown vectors related to the 2D component. The issue is due to improper handling of certain inputs, which can lead to unauthorized access or execution of arbitrary code.\r\n\r\n### General Mitigation Advice\r\n\r\n1. **Update Java**: Ensure that you are using the latest version of Java, as Oracle regularly releases patches that address known vulnerabilities.\r\n2. **Restrict Network Access**: Limit network access to systems running Java applications to trusted users and networks.\r\n3. **Use Security Manager**: Enable the Java Security Manager to enforce a security policy that restricts what Java applications can do.\r\n4. **Input Validation**: Implement strict input validation to prevent malicious data from being processed by the application.\r\n5. **Code Review**: Regularly review and audit your code for potential security issues.\r\n\r\n### Source Code Fix Recommendation\r\n\r\nWhile the specific source code fix for CVE-2015-2597 is not publicly available, general best practices for mitigating similar vulnerabilities include:\r\n\r\n- **Sanitize Inputs**: Ensure that all inputs are properly sanitized and validated before processing.\r\n- **Use Safe Libraries**: Utilize well-maintained libraries and frameworks that are known to handle inputs securely.\r\n- **Apply Principle of Least Privilege**: Run Java applications with the minimum privileges necessary to reduce the impact of a potential exploit.\r\n\r\n### Relevant OWASP Resources\r\n\r\n- [OWASP Top Ten](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\r\n\r\n### Common Weakness Enumeration (CWE)\r\n\r\n- **CWE-20: Improper Input Validation**: This vulnerability is related to improper input validation, which is a common issue in software development. More information can be found on the [CWE-20 page](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/20.html)."
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "CVE-2015-2597/suse:java:"
                ]
              }
